      "lines": [
        "§62. 球面和球体"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**1. 定义1. 到已知点的距离等于已知正数$R$的空间所有**",
        "**的点的集合叫做球面.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知点$O$就是球心(图89). 线段$OM$($M$是球面上的点)",
        "叫做球面的半径($|OM|=R$)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "连结球面上任意两点的线段叫做球面的弦. 通过中心$O$",
        "的弦叫做球面的直径. 直径的长等于半径的二倍(图89)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 89",
      "box": [
